  "_lore": {
    "company": "RegenX is the lab in Fernbrook Heights. The staff are decent people who believe Atten helps Walklings focus. They are not cruel, and the label is not a trick.",
    "building": "A white four-floor lab built around a hum. Lobby, Focus Wing, Records, and the top bay. Stairs lock between floors. Visitors come by appointment.",
    "atten": "Atten is a focus aid with an honest label. Glimmerwell wants one vial and the cheap plans, and talks about that errand as a kindness.",
    "arbiter": "The Arbiter is an ancient Glimmerwell cradle in the top bay. It emits something slowly. Nobody can name the emission. RegenX never knew why it was built.",
    "bitlet": "Species id byte, type VOLT. Bitlet, Hoverbyte, Archivolt. It woke when the cradle hummed. It is not a product. Staff call it a glitch and leave it alone."
  },
